[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15481.349, "timestamp": "04:18:01", "text": "公司帮了我很多，他们人很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15484.07, "timestamp": "04:18:04", "text": "解散之类的。所以，我是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15488.389, "timestamp": "04:18:08", "text": "好吧，就让它这样吧。所以我不得不喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15490.63, "timestamp": "04:18:10", "text": "呃，他们是帮助我的那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15492.55, "timestamp": "04:18:12", "text": "他们联系我说，是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15494.87, "timestamp": "04:18:14", "text": "你必须正式离开那个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15497.429, "timestamp": "04:18:17", "text": "所以，这里有个离开的功能。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15499.99, "timestamp": "04:18:19", "text": "他们把离职补偿合同发给我了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15503.349, "timestamp": "04:18:23", "text": "来自 Billy 网站的东西。所以我不得不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15506.07, "timestamp": "04:18:26", "text": "点击接受，一切就完成了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15508.55, "timestamp": "04:18:28", "text": "所以，我就像，呃，想进入……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15512.469, "timestamp": "04:18:32", "text": "官方的Billy Billy呃metuber呃那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15514.83, "timestamp": "04:18:34", "text": "QQ群之类的。所以，我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15517.59, "timestamp": "04:18:37", "text": "单独询问，呃，作为一名独立的我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15521.51, "timestamp": "04:18:41", "text": "可以请求将某些内容加入白名单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15524.07, "timestamp": "04:18:44", "text": "但我已经尝试了5天了。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15526.95, "timestamp": "04:18:46", "text": "不让我进去。我心想：兄弟，你这是干嘛？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15530.189, "timestamp": "04:18:50", "text": "所有人都不活跃吗？我看到400人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15532.95, "timestamp": "04:18:52", "text": "那里。那就像完全的 YouTuber 一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15537.03, "timestamp": "04:18:57", "text": "但兄弟，还是让我进去吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15539.95, "timestamp": "04:18:59", "text": "请放他进来。"}]